# Storage tools: an optional stage, shipped as a system extension image and
# enabled with pos-stage (BUILD.md "Storage stage"). The root's and the
# ESP's file system tools (e2fsprogs, dosfstools) are the system stage's.
# File systems: XFS (with liburcu and inih), Btrfs, exFAT.
userspace-rcu
inih
xfsprogs
btrfs-progs
exfatprogs
# Volumes: LVM and device-mapper (with libaio and the thin and cache
# tools), software RAID.
libaio
thin-provisioning-tools
lvm2
mdadm
# Encryption and integrity: cryptsetup, veritysetup, integritysetup.
cryptsetup
# Network block storage: iSCSI (with iSNS), NVMe and NVMe over Fabrics.
open-isns
open-iscsi
nvme-cli
# Drive health.
smartmontools
